# This project keeps environment variables per-service:
#   backend/.env.example   -- Supabase service-role, HF, OSRM, ranking policy, demo admin token
#   frontend/.env.example  -- Supabase anon key (client-safe only), API base URL
#
# Copy each to backend/.env and frontend/.env and fill in real values.
# Never put a Supabase service-role key or HF token in frontend/.env.
